      "common:UUID": "0ce3dedb-caca-407b-a856-a90470eb8ec0",
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Elementary flow for particulate matter emitted to air, unspecified subcompartment, where the particle-size fraction is not specified. The reference property is mass, expressed in kilograms. No particular particle-size distribution, chemical composition, stack height or LCIA characterization factor is assigned by this Flow definition. Source context retained from the preceding version: Song et al. (2021), DOI 10.13671/j.hjkxxb.2021.0276, reports 0.01689 kg/t of particulate-matter emissions from clinker preheating and calcination after dust collection, without reporting particle size. This is a source-specific application example, not the amount per kilogram of this Flow or a requirement that all uses represent the same treatment technology. Actual emissions, controls and source evidence belong to the corresponding Process exchange; characterization coverage is assessed for the exact Flow and the selected LCIA method.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "用于表示排放至空气、子环境未特指且粒径分级未给出的颗粒物基本流，参考属性为质量，以千克计。该流定义不指定特定粒径分布、化学组成、排放高度或影响评价表征因子。保留前继版本的来源背景：宋晓玲等（2021，DOI 10.13671/j.hjkxxb.2021.0276）报告熟料预热与煅烧除尘后颗粒物排放合计0.01689 kg/t，未报告粒径。这是来源特定的应用案例，不是该流每千克对应的排放量，也不限定所有使用场景采用相同治理工艺。实际排放量、治理情况及来源依据应记录于相应Process的exchange；表征覆盖须按精确流和所选影响评价方法核查。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
